WEBVTT

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:15.740
Step aside, Kotarou-kun.

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:17.240
Kotori...

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:21.180
If the Salvation comes to pass, 
the Key will return to Earth,

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:23.480
and I'll lose my Druid powers.

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:24.750
And if that happens...

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:30.090
As a probable monster who's only 
alive thanks to your powers,

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:30.760
I'll die?

00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:33.370
I wouldn't be able to bear that.

00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:36.760
You're the only hope I have left in this world!

00:00:37.210 --> 00:00:39.120
It'll be fine.

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:43.140
Druids have ways to prevent the Key 
from returning to Earth, even if it dies.

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:46.020
So I won't let you be erased.

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:47.520
I'll prove it to you.

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:49.770
Prove...?

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:54.140
If I were really a monster, 
I wouldn't be able to defy my master.

00:00:54.140 --> 00:00:57.780
So I'll go against your wishes 
to prove that I'm not.

00:00:58.040 --> 00:01:00.010
My wishes?

00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:03.290
You want to run away from all 
this Key and Druid stuff, right?

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:05.550
I won't let you.

00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:08.790
I'll force you to make the most difficult choice.

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:11.480
You want me to keep suffering?

00:01:11.480 --> 00:01:12.460
That's right.

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:14.050
Because I'm not a monster.

00:01:14.980 --> 00:01:16.930
I'm Tennouji Kotarou, the man.

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:18.560
No!

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:20.180
You are a monster!

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:24.330
The Kotarou-kun I knew 
wasn't the least bit cheery!

00:01:24.330 --> 00:01:26.940
He was moody, unsociable,

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:29.910
cold, and not at all nice...

00:01:30.810 --> 00:01:34.560
And he didn't save me!

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:37.950
You're a monster.

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:40.540
One created by my desires,

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:43.560
with the kind of personality I wanted.

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:45.450
A monster...

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:47.780
Say, Kotori.

00:01:48.130 --> 00:01:51.580
The Key must've been a 
huge burden to you, right?

00:01:51.580 --> 00:01:52.460
Wrong!

00:01:52.990 --> 00:01:55.120
I'll fight your weakness.

00:01:55.480 --> 00:01:58.640
If you're gonna waver from your 
duty, then I'll protect the Key.

00:01:58.640 --> 00:01:59.600
So please...

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:02.470
Let's fight together until the very end.

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:09.000
You really are not at all nice.

00:02:20.710 --> 00:02:21.940
Tell me.

00:02:21.940 --> 00:02:22.980
What?

00:02:22.980 --> 00:02:24.770
What is the Salvation?

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:27.410
Is it something that'll make 
the world a better place?

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:28.540
It's ruin.

00:02:39.770 --> 00:02:40.500
Kaga—

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:49.060
Shizuru?

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:50.500
Kotarou-kun...

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:51.690
The Key...

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.830
Kotarou...

00:03:12.280 --> 00:03:14.590
Proof...

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:17.790
Proof... Proof?

00:03:17.790 --> 00:03:19.840
Hey, what do you mean by "proof"?

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:21.720
How do you know my name?

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:23.190
Hey.

00:03:23.730 --> 00:03:25.540
Hey! Hey!

00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:36.520
I have to go.

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:37.980
But where?

00:03:40.430 --> 00:03:41.300
A hill?

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:43.200
Oh, right.

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:44.780
That hill.

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:31.500
Episode 14
"Three Cups of Coffee"

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:30.680
<i>I have this faint inkling</i>

00:04:31.240 --> 00:04:34.750
<i>that a myriad of times that aren't now 
and countless places that aren't here</i>

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:37.500
<i>came together to form this one night.</i>

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:40.460
<i>And I'm positive I'll find her there.</i>

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:42.140
<i>"Her"?</i>

00:04:42.140 --> 00:04:43.660
<i>Who's that supposed to be?</i>

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:51.640
Hey, you th—

00:05:14.490 --> 00:05:17.620
<i>So this is far as I get tonight.</i>

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:28.140
Get going, Shizuru.

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:31.870
What am I supposed to do without you?

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:33.520
I won't have anything left!

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:45.530
The look on your face says it'll be all right.

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:47.850
I can change.

00:05:48.190 --> 00:05:51.040
I'll change so much, no destruction 
or whatever will beat me.

00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:53.540
And I'll wait for you here.

00:05:54.850 --> 00:05:55.410
No...

00:05:55.640 --> 00:05:57.170
No, no, no!

00:05:57.170 --> 00:05:58.290
No!

00:05:58.670 --> 00:05:59.910
Don't worry.

00:05:59.910 --> 00:06:03.420
You'll always be a part of me.

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:06.720
So please find me,

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:09.180
even if I change a little too much, okay?

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:10.290
Kotarou...

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:11.680
Kotarou!

00:06:12.200 --> 00:06:13.840
If only time would...

00:06:15.840 --> 00:06:17.060
We should hurry.

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:21.440
I love you.

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:24.900
I love you more than anyone or anything.

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:27.050
Me too, Shizuru.

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:28.460
Later.

00:06:33.360 --> 00:06:35.130
Let's meet again

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:38.280
in the next go-around.

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:48.090
All right.

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:08.940
<i>I have to say, this is 
quite the pleasant night.</i>

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:14.950
H-Hey...

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:26.590
Are you alone?

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:33.840
Aren't you lonely staying 
here all by yourself?

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:36.970
Don't you wanna talk to 
someone once in a while?

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:44.260
I'm Tennouji Kotarou.

00:07:44.260 --> 00:07:47.110
I'd like it if you'd just call me Kotarou.

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:48.650
What's your name?

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:49.810
If you don't mind,

00:07:49.810 --> 00:07:52.110
could we kill some time with a friendly chat?

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:53.450
Er...

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:55.220
What are you doing?

00:07:55.220 --> 00:07:56.910
Oh, I know. Homework.

00:07:56.910 --> 00:07:58.120
Okay, I'll help—

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:05.880
Is that my...

00:08:17.170 --> 00:08:19.010
Such a party atmosphere.

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:20.890
Well, the Harvest Festa is coming up.

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:23.360
The Harvest Festa?

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:26.230
Want to go to it together?

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:29.880
The mess with the Gaia 
radicals has been cleared up.

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:32.150
Surely we can take some time off to relax.

00:08:33.090 --> 00:08:34.530
You're right!

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:38.160
<i>Man, my girlfriend is adorable!</i>

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:43.090
What's that over there?

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:45.420
Hey, Chihaya!

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:49.670
There sure is a lot of stuff here.

00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:54.010
Excuse me.

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:55.610
I'll take this one.

00:08:58.010 --> 00:08:59.960
You like it?

00:08:59.960 --> 00:09:01.930
W-Well, yeah.

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:07.330
Like it?

00:09:07.330 --> 00:09:09.970
I can't see it clearly enough to answer.

00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:12.940
But it's kind of cute.

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:16.070
Oh, good. I thought it'd look great on you.

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:19.070
C-Can I really have it?

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:21.370
Yeah. To commemorate our first date.

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:23.950
Thank you very much.

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:32.340
You're taking it off?!

00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:35.200
I can't see it well when I'm wearing it.

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:37.940
And it's kind of embarrassing...

00:09:37.940 --> 00:09:39.560
R-Right...

00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:41.590
But, hey, that's how it usually goes.

00:09:41.590 --> 00:09:43.350
I-I guess.

00:09:44.940 --> 00:09:47.040
Hey! Even I can't see it now!

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:49.870
What's the problem? At least I'm wearing it.

00:09:49.870 --> 00:09:52.360
C'mon, give me a little peek.

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:55.360
Oh, fine.

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:57.030
Sweet, I see 'em.

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:08.250
<i>My memories are at their freshest 
just before I wake up.</i>

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:10.250
<i>Over and over and over,</i>

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:13.500
<i>I try to talk to the girl, get killed,</i>

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:15.720
<i>and have a dream of memories.</i>

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:20.680
We're getting married.
Thanks for everything.
Tennouji Kotarou & Kotori

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:19.950
<i>In one memory,</i>

00:10:19.950 --> 00:10:22.260
<i>I had a family with Kotori.</i>

00:10:22.740 --> 00:10:24.030
<i>It was bliss.</i>

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:25.270
<i>However...</i>

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:26.340
Cheers!

00:10:26.340 --> 00:10:27.910
<i>In another memory...</i>

00:10:27.910 --> 00:10:31.910
And this guy went, "In ten minutes, 
I'll drown your rotten corpse!"

00:10:31.910 --> 00:10:33.960
What? That guy sounds hilarious.

00:10:31.910 --> 00:10:34.900
<i>I'd somehow gotten to know 
an OL living in Setagaya,</i>

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:37.490
<i>Hamada Michiko-san, and married her.</i>

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:41.850
<i>And in another, me and 
Akane-san, of all people,</i>

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:44.660
<i>were in an adult relationship.</i>

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:48.290
<i>I also found myself in a paradise 
beyond my wildest dreams!</i>

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:51.060
<i>I mean, she's dynamite by herself,</i>

00:10:51.060 --> 00:10:53.680
<i>but there were two of her! Two of her!</i>

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:57.270
<i>The ruin of civilization.</i>

00:10:57.670 --> 00:10:58.800
<i>Gaia's remnants.</i>

00:10:59.570 --> 00:11:00.950
<i>Idola's monsters.</i>

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:03.140
<i>Hunters.</i>

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:05.640
<i>At times,</i>

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:07.560
<i>I lived as a soldier</i>

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:10.030
<i>in a world straight out of some LN.</i>

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:16.900
<i>This is a memory of fighting Gaia's mad dog.</i>

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:18.430
<i>In the end,</i>

00:11:18.430 --> 00:11:21.660
<i>was it never possible to reach 
an understanding with him?</i>

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:23.910
<i>Oh, right.</i>

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:26.760
<i>I even have a memory of racing down 
a highway at night with Shizuru,</i>

00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:29.910
<i>enacting a chase scene right 
out of a Hollywood blockbuster.</i>

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:35.040
<i>But this is where the contradiction 
rears its ugly head.</i>

00:11:35.430 --> 00:11:37.550
<i>These memories are so inconsistent,</i>

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:39.670
<i>they couldn't possibly be from the same life.</i>

00:11:40.140 --> 00:11:42.240
<i>It's like I've been reborn countless times</i>

00:11:42.240 --> 00:11:44.770
<i>and lived different lives each time.</i>

00:11:45.360 --> 00:11:46.590
<i>That's absurd.</i>

00:11:47.310 --> 00:11:48.370
<i>But I can't think</i>

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:51.810
<i>of any other way to explain 
my inconsistent memories.</i>

00:11:52.090 --> 00:11:55.970
<i>So I stop racking my brain and 
focus on the task ahead of me.</i>

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:57.340
<i>Yes,</i>

00:11:57.570 --> 00:12:00.820
<i>the terrifying task of talking 
to this impregnable girl.</i>

00:12:01.310 --> 00:12:03.070
<i>This is something I must do.</i>

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:06.830
<i>Because it's the only thing 
I have to cling to right now.</i>

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:08.490
Hey.

00:12:12.070 --> 00:12:14.880
<i>But, of course, I failed again.</i>

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:19.840
Man, I'm running out of material.

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:24.550
Maybe I should just try a bolder method.

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:29.010
Like attacking her or something.

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:30.680
Nah, that won't do.

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:33.920
Socializing calls for a friendlier approach...

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:37.160
In terms of trying to attract her attention,

00:12:37.160 --> 00:12:38.900
isn't this just like hitting on a girl?

00:12:39.760 --> 00:12:41.780
I can't seem to get you off my mind.

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:44.140
I'm sure we'd make a great couple.

00:12:44.140 --> 00:12:47.070
So please don't be so wary, baby.

00:12:58.640 --> 00:12:59.090
Hey...

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:01.710
Why don't we go out?

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:05.970
My love is unstoppable!

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:09.350
I love you.

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:13.060
No!

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:16.690
Play with adults, and you'll get burned.

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:19.890
I'm melting away!

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:24.810
I'm not getting anywhere!

00:13:24.810 --> 00:13:26.440
Killing me just for trying to approach her?

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:29.240
This goes way beyond playing hard to get!

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:32.470
Oh, come on!

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:37.830
Yeah, yeah, I know.

00:13:38.220 --> 00:13:39.600
It's the same.

00:13:39.600 --> 00:13:42.830
Even here, everything I do is pointless.

00:13:43.540 --> 00:13:45.240
I just wanted somewhere to belong.

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:47.840
I wanted to mean something to people.

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:50.680
I was scared of being left alone.

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:51.910
That's right!

00:13:51.910 --> 00:13:54.720
That's why I started the occult club, too!

00:13:55.200 --> 00:13:57.120
What's wrong with that?

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:58.900
Everyone's like that!

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:01.730
So why have I been singled 
out and hauled off here?

00:14:02.210 --> 00:14:03.780
Why am I the only one

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:06.460
in this place?!

00:14:08.970 --> 00:14:10.810
I'm a puny guy.

00:14:11.440 --> 00:14:12.880
A small-time guy who tried

00:14:13.260 --> 00:14:16.020
to get through life curled up 
into a tiny ball. That's all.

00:14:16.020 --> 00:14:16.920
So why...

00:14:18.050 --> 00:14:20.650
Why won't you leave me alone?

00:14:25.580 --> 00:14:26.470
Go ahead.

00:14:26.470 --> 00:14:28.010
Kill me.

00:14:28.740 --> 00:14:30.940
Help me not think about anything anymore.

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:32.940
Turn me into nothing.

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:34.510
Please.

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:40.440
What is your deal?!

00:14:40.760 --> 00:14:42.270
Who the hell are you?!

00:14:47.560 --> 00:14:48.460
Did you

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:51.320
just say "Kagari"?

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:54.030
K-Kagari?

00:14:56.070 --> 00:14:58.950
I-I've been wanting to ask.

00:14:58.950 --> 00:15:00.540
Are you always alone?

00:15:02.970 --> 00:15:05.090
And, although I don't remember it,

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:07.720
we've met before, haven't we?

00:15:07.720 --> 00:15:09.800
And not once or twice, either.

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:13.890
I don't know if I should call 
you a hard worker or what...

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:16.120
Oh, yeah, it's a bit late to ask,

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:17.310
but what is this thing?

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:27.260
<i>What the hell is this?</i>

00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:28.450
<i>A theory?</i>

00:15:28.450 --> 00:15:30.610
<i>This whole thing was</i>

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:34.320
<i>a super-dense mass of information?!</i>

00:15:46.280 --> 00:15:49.460
<i>Is this a theory of life?!</i>

00:15:53.620 --> 00:15:55.970
<i>There were battles revolving around the Key.</i>

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:59.540
<i>I took part in those battles, 
at times as part of Gaia,</i>

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:01.060
<i>at times as a member of Guardian,</i>

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:01.980
<i>and at times as...</i>

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:05.320
<i>Some considered the Key Earth's messenger,</i>

00:16:05.320 --> 00:16:07.290
<i>sent to punish humanity for its hubris,</i>

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:10.150
<i>and some considered her 
Earth's immune system.</i>

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:11.990
<i>But, in the end,</i>

00:16:12.690 --> 00:16:16.760
<i>everyone died without learning 
anything about the Key.</i>

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:21.660
Are you researching a way 
to destroy the world?

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:25.100
Humanity ruined the environment too much,

00:16:25.100 --> 00:16:27.000
so you're going to destroy it?

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:31.310
Figures.

00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:51.970
Kotori?

00:16:53.050 --> 00:16:53.990
Hey...

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:57.840
You're all by yourself in 
such a lonely place again?

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:06.920
Akane-san?

00:17:07.310 --> 00:17:08.460
What the heck?

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:10.530
You're looking awfully thin.

00:17:21.740 --> 00:17:22.780
Lucia?

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:32.070
Did she run away?

00:17:32.550 --> 00:17:33.680
Oh, right.

00:17:33.680 --> 00:17:36.380
I can't touch her unless it's through a cloth.

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:40.260
Is this...

00:17:43.940 --> 00:17:46.330
There's no fish or charcoal to use it with.

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:53.860
You're always such a nice girl, Shizuru.

00:17:57.860 --> 00:18:00.350
This place is way too big for two people.

00:18:06.930 --> 00:18:10.080
This is all she had, huh?

00:18:18.050 --> 00:18:20.190
<i>I thought this town was deserted,</i>

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:21.990
<i>but I was wrong.</i>

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:25.800
<i>Those were signs and vestiges of life.</i>

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:31.000
<i>I bet it's all connected somehow.</i>

00:18:43.780 --> 00:18:47.400
<i>After that, I got killed countless 
times, and gained in return</i>

00:18:47.400 --> 00:18:49.280
<i>this comfortable distance between us.</i>

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:51.620
<i>I actually quite like it.</i>

00:18:51.960 --> 00:18:55.000
<i>After all, since we can't communicate,</i>

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:58.430
<i>there are no lies or lip 
service in this relationship.</i>

00:18:58.850 --> 00:19:02.780
<i>It's a completely pure connection 
I built with my own hands.</i>

00:19:05.530 --> 00:19:09.290
<i>It seems Kagari's research 
isn't proceeding too smoothly.</i>

00:19:10.020 --> 00:19:12.100
<i>Is there anything I can do to help?</i>

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:26.780
Why don't you take a break?

00:19:35.320 --> 00:19:36.190
Yum!

00:19:49.520 --> 00:19:51.380
I'm a human, not a tree!

00:19:52.890 --> 00:19:56.460
Crap, I spaced out for months!

00:20:00.740 --> 00:20:03.290
Did your research hit a brick wall again?

00:20:08.280 --> 00:20:10.480
Uh, here you go.

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:31.980
I actually don't want to 
drink this muddy water,

00:20:31.980 --> 00:20:33.680
but you left me no choice!

00:20:34.050 --> 00:20:35.260
As if.

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:39.290
Uh, are you...

00:20:41.900 --> 00:20:44.320
You weren't asking for seconds, huh?

00:20:46.600 --> 00:20:49.400
Trying to win me over 
with a drink like that?

00:20:49.400 --> 00:20:52.020
I suppose that's all an 
inferior human could think of.

00:20:52.420 --> 00:20:53.520
As if.

00:20:57.820 --> 00:21:01.280
<i>And, yet again, time passes 
without feeling like it.</i>

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:13.290
I-I'll make some right away.

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:30.900
H-Hey...

00:21:46.050 --> 00:21:48.070
<i>Welp, I'm dead again.</i>

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:01.630
Kagari?

00:22:02.160 --> 00:22:04.300
A-Are you sure?

00:22:07.740 --> 00:22:10.350
<i>Are you telling me</i>

00:22:11.020 --> 00:22:13.100
<i>three cups of coffee was all it took</i>

00:22:13.100 --> 00:22:15.950
<i>to break down the last barrier between us?</i>

00:22:18.990 --> 00:22:20.940
<i>We're not friends,</i>

00:22:20.940 --> 00:22:22.250
<i>lovers,</i>

00:22:22.250 --> 00:22:24.110
<i>family, or anything.</i>

00:22:24.820 --> 00:22:26.040
<i>Forget all that.</i>

00:22:26.440 --> 00:22:28.430
<i>We can't even talk to each other.</i>

00:22:29.500 --> 00:22:30.370
<i>But...</i>

00:22:31.300 --> 00:22:35.420
<i>Even though it's so thin that 
it could snap at any moment,</i>

00:22:35.970 --> 00:22:37.870
<i>there is something connecting us.</i>

00:22:41.100 --> 00:22:43.500
<i>I found my answer.</i>

00:22:44.260 --> 00:22:48.180
<i>I wouldn't mind risking my 
life for this right here!</i>

00:23:05.440 --> 00:23:07.540
<i>Yeah, Kagari...</i>

00:23:07.870 --> 00:23:08.900
<i>You were never</i>

00:23:10.160 --> 00:23:13.030
<i>some incomprehensible being!</i>
